WEBVTT

00:04:29.829 --> 00:04:31.579
where they overlap with others,

00:04:31.579 --> 00:04:34.079
and the differences between them 
are gradual—

00:04:34.079 --> 00:04:35.288
not clear cut.

00:04:35.496 --> 00:04:39.079
And that’s the confounding
beauty of the dynamic, diverse,

00:04:39.079 --> 00:04:42.413
and dazzling universe 
of human communication.